
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant Faculty
    participant UI as React UI
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as MongoDB

    Note over Faculty,DB: Publish office-hour availability
    Faculty->>API: Publish availability
    API->>DB: Save AvailabilitySlot(facultyId, start, end)

    Student->>UI: Open mentor page and select free slot
    UI->>API: POST /api/meetings {slotId, studentId} + JWT
    API->>API: Verify role = Student and assignment exists
    API->>DB: Find slot and check booking conflict
    DB-->>API: Return slot status

    alt Slot is free
        API->>DB: Create Meeting(status=scheduled), mark slot booked
        DB-->>API: Saved
        API-->>UI: 201 Created + meeting details
        UI-->>Student: Show booking confirmation
    else Slot already taken
        API-->>UI: 409 Conflict: slot unavailable
        UI-->>Student: Show error, ask to choose another slot
    end

    Note over Student,DB: After the meeting takes place
    Faculty->>UI: Add note and mark meeting completed
    UI->>API: POST /api/meetings/:id/notes {text}
    API->>DB: Insert MeetingNote, set Meeting.status=completed
    DB-->>API: Saved
    API-->>UI: 201 Created
    UI-->>Faculty: Note visible to mentor and admin only
